WEBVTT

00:06.040 --> 00:08.480
I am Prince of Jin Sikong Yao of Great Xuan

00:08.560 --> 00:09.920
I promise you all

00:10.000 --> 00:10.840
Great Xuan has never for a day

00:10.920 --> 00:12.920
Forgotten the people of the north

00:13.320 --> 00:13.600
The royal army

00:13.680 --> 00:15.347
Will surely recover the homeland

00:15.800 --> 00:16.920
Return to everyone

00:17.000 --> 00:18.400
A peaceful realm

00:19.480 --> 00:20.880
How wonderful

00:22.120 --> 00:23.787
Great Xuan hasn't forgotten us

00:24.120 --> 00:25.960
The royal army has finally come, Your Highness

00:26.040 --> 00:27.707
Let's hurry on our way

00:28.680 --> 00:29.840
Military duties call

00:29.920 --> 00:31.320
Cannot stay long

00:41.440 --> 00:42.840
For you

00:52.360 --> 00:53.760
Continue on our way

00:55.560 --> 00:56.800
In September

00:56.880 --> 00:57.960
Xuan Kingdom's great army

00:58.040 --> 00:58.920
Crossed the Tianhe

00:59.000 --> 01:00.400
Went fully north

01:01.000 --> 01:02.520
The northern regions heard the news

01:02.600 --> 01:04.480
And opened their gates to welcome

01:04.560 --> 01:06.800
Righteous armies also rose in response

01:07.560 --> 01:08.920
To pave the way for the returning royal army

01:09.000 --> 01:10.160
They

01:10.240 --> 01:11.400
Did not fear death

01:11.480 --> 01:13.000
And spared no cost

01:13.360 --> 01:14.160
Therefore

01:14.240 --> 01:16.520
All armies quickly followed the plan

01:16.600 --> 01:18.800
And occupied all strategic locations

01:20.000 --> 01:20.240
However

01:20.320 --> 01:21.480
Two months later

01:21.560 --> 01:23.040
The Wutu organized a great army

01:23.160 --> 01:24.720
Divided into three routes going south

01:24.800 --> 01:25.960
Quickly retook

01:26.040 --> 01:27.440
Some cities

01:27.880 --> 01:28.800
Any city that opened its gates

01:28.880 --> 01:30.080
To welcome the Xuan army

01:30.160 --> 01:32.480
Was completely massacred

01:54.240 --> 01:55.640
The Wutu great army

01:55.800 --> 01:56.240
From the east

01:56.360 --> 01:56.560
West

01:56.680 --> 01:57.160
North

01:57.240 --> 01:58.480
Surrounded the city on three sides

01:58.560 --> 01:59.920
According to scouts' reports

02:00.000 --> 02:00.360
They brought

02:00.440 --> 02:01.360
A craftsmen camp

02:01.440 --> 02:02.720
To build rams on site

02:02.800 --> 02:04.160
Catapults

02:04.240 --> 02:05.907
They probably won't attack immediately

02:07.360 --> 02:08.760
Report

02:09.120 --> 02:09.600
General

02:09.680 --> 02:10.960
Military report has arrived

02:11.040 --> 02:11.800
Let's go

02:11.880 --> 02:13.547
Back to the council hall

02:18.040 --> 02:18.960
This military report

02:19.040 --> 02:20.707
Is already three days old

02:20.800 --> 02:21.840
The Wutu Great Chanyu

02:21.920 --> 02:22.600
Ayidai

02:22.680 --> 02:24.400
Personally leads one hundred thirty thousand infantry and cavalry

02:24.480 --> 02:25.160
Toward General Zu Kun

02:25.240 --> 02:26.640
Who garrisons Xingyang

02:26.800 --> 02:27.720
Right General

02:27.800 --> 02:28.400
Ayigu

02:28.480 --> 02:29.160
Leads twenty thousand cavalry

02:29.240 --> 02:30.907
To intercept Zu Yue's forces

02:31.000 --> 02:32.160
Surrounding us now

02:32.240 --> 02:33.280
Is Left General Shilang

02:33.360 --> 02:34.760
Leading fifty thousand tribesmen
